    ||'|CanSubmit='||case when rpp."CanSubmit" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanVerify='||case when rpp."CanVerify" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanApprove='||case when rpp."CanApprove" then 'T' else 'F' end
    ||'|CanReject='||case when rpp."CanReject" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanRequestClarification='||case when rpp."CanRequestClarification" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanRequestRevision='||case when rpp."CanRequestRevision" then 'T' else 'F' end
