    ||'|CanPrint='||case when rpp."CanPrint" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanDownload='||case when rpp."CanDownload" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanExport='||case when rpp."CanExport" then 'T' else 'F' end
    ||'|CanUploadAttachment='||case when rpp."CanUploadAttachment" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanReplaceAttachment='||case when rpp."CanReplaceAttachment" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|CanViewCommercialValues='||case when rpp."CanViewCommercialValues" then 'T' else 'F' end
    ||'|CanViewAuditHistory='||case when rpp."CanViewAuditHistory" then 'T' else 'F' end||'|HasFullControl='||case when rpp."HasFullControl" then 'T' else 'F' end
